  "body": "Positioned just steps from Rothesay Bay Beach, this original four-bedroom home presents an exciting opportunity for buyers looking to add value in a premium coastal location.\r\n\r\nSet on a half share of 1,343sqm (more or less), the property is currently tenanted and offers clear scope for renovation and improvement. With four bedrooms and one bathroom, the home provides a solid starting point for those ready to roll up their sleeves and unlock its potential.\r\n\r\nOpportunities to secure an original home this close to Rothesay Bay Beach are increasingly rare. Whether you're looking for a renovation project, investment, or future land holding, the upside here is undeniable.\r\n\r\nEnjoy the convenience of being just a short stroll to the beach, local shops, cafes, and excellent schooling, making this a fantastic opportunity in a tightly held coastal community.\r\n\r\nContact Rory Blair - Prestige Real Estate for more information or to arrange a viewing.",
